d allows convenient access to all functions, cameras, buttons and ports. Redesigned TPU frame, and extra reinforcement from hard PC material provides aesthetic.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;div class="box"&gt; &lt;div class="title"&gt; &lt;i class="fa fa-plane"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Shipping &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;We ship ALL in-stock orders on the same day or the next business day after cleared payment received. We do not ship on weekends or holidays.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;US and CANADA only.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;For other international locations please contact us to get a shipping quote.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;When your shipment is confirmed, you will receive a shipment confirmation e-mail.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Domestic Orders: Items will be shipped via USPS First Class Mail or Parcel Post Transit time is approximately 2-7 business days.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;International Orders: Items will be shipped via USPS First Class International Mail, Transit time is approximately 7-25 business days.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;div class="box"&gt; &lt;div class="title"&gt; &lt;i class="fa fa-refresh"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Returns &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Please use "Contact Seller" link in your account or click &lt;a href="${store.contactUsUrl}" target="_blank"&gt;Contact us&lt;/a&gt; link to send us an email.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Customers are responsible for determining their products compatibility with what we have for sale. We provide a general compatibility list, but please make sure that it will actually be compatible with your product. If purchasing a case, pouch, holster, clip please be aware that if you have an extended battery that it will most likely not fit. Pictures are for a general reference only. The item you get may differ from the one shown. The colors may be different as well as every computer displays colors differently.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &l